# Release packaging (docs/BANDWIDTH.md): the VM release tarball is a
# `git archive` of the tree. Source files, review renders, contact sheets and
# documentation are never loaded by the game, so they stay out of it.
# server-node/bandwidth.test.js fails if a file the client actually requests
# is ever listed here.
*.blend export-ignore
*.blend1 export-ignore
**/sheet-*.png export-ignore
**/*-review.png export-ignore
**/*-review.html export-ignore
assets/racing/apex-car-*.png export-ignore
js/title-models.js export-ignore
docs/** export-ignore
goals export-ignore
amanchat-old-firebase export-ignore
server/** export-ignore
tools/blender/** export-ignore
